ontainers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_details":[{"id":"sd-jin035-peiwei-jing-julu-request","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAAA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-ws2506399-peiwei","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002","quote":"初，頠兄子憬為白衣，頠論述世勳，賜爵高陽亭侯。楊駿將誅也，駿党左軍將軍劉豫陳兵在門，遇頠，問太傅所在。頠紿之曰：「向於西掖門遇公乘素車，從二人西出矣。」豫曰：「吾何之？」頠曰：「宜至廷尉。」豫從頠言，遂委而去。尋而詔頠代豫領左軍將軍，屯萬春門。及駿誅，以功當封武昌侯，頠請以封憬，帝竟封頠次子該。頠苦陳憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿，先帝恩旨，辭不獲命。武昌之封，己之所蒙，特請以封憬。該時尚主，故帝不聽。累遷侍中。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002:m0151"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"固定完整原段的有限來源細節，未知年月、親等及任官結果保持原範圍。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin035-peiwei-finite","slot":"jing-julu-request"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei","source_term":"憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002","start":151,"end":160,"surface":"憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿"},"source_revision":2506399,"paragraph_sha256":"67df61ad24a536f6e5c2216f5f306ba12570939fd3c93f4b0a095f3149554fe1","date_expression":null,"kind":"unimplemented_title_proposal_report","values":{"title_source_name":"钜鹿","grant_attested":false}},{"id":"sd-jin035-peixiu-detail-079","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAAA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-ws2506399-peixiu","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu:p013","quote":"咸甯初，與石苞等並為王公，配享廟庭。有二子：浚、頠。浚嗣位，至散騎常侍，早卒。浚庶子憬不惠，別封高陽亭侯，以浚少弟頠嗣。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu:p013:m0042"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"保來源表述，不作現代病名。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_wit